-- Regulation W, 12 CFR Part 223.3: company, person, subsidiary and control.
--
-- Target compiler: main (see NOTES.md).
--
-- How "control" is computed.
-- 223.3(g)(3) says a company controls the securities its subsidiaries hold, and 223.3(ii) says a
-- subsidiary is a company the first company controls, so control is defined in terms of itself.
-- This module takes the LEAST fixed point of that definition: it starts from no control, and a
-- pair (controller, company) is added only once the text makes it true given the pairs already
-- added.  A group of companies that each hold less than 25 percent of one another is therefore
-- not found to control one another merely because they could be read as doing so (NOTES.md,
-- "Cross-holdings").
--
-- Why the recursion ends: `control from` is given the pairs still undecided, and it calls itself
-- only on that list after at least one pair has been removed from it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `regw-nouns`

§ `223.3(f), (bb): company and person`

-- 223.3(f): a corporation, partnership, limited liability company, business trust, association,
-- or similar organization and, unless specifically excluded, a member bank and a depository
-- institution.
GIVEN
    s IS A Structure
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(f)
`is a company` MEANS
    CONSIDER p's `kind`
    WHEN Corporation                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN Partnership                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Limited liability company`  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Business trust`             THEN TRUE
    WHEN Association                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Similar organization`       THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE
           p's `is a depository institution`
        OR p's `name` EQUALS s's `the member bank`

-- 223.3(bb): an individual, company, trust, joint venture, pool, syndicate, sole proprietorship,
-- unincorporated organization, or any other form of entity.  Every kind of party is one of those.
GIVEN
    s IS A Structure
    p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(bb)
`is a person` MEANS TRUE

§ `Looking parties up`

GIVEN
    s    IS A Structure
    name IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`names a company` MEANS
    any (GIVEN q YIELD q's `name` EQUALS name AND `is a company` s q) (s's `the parties`)

GIVEN
    s    IS A Structure
    name IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`names a business trust` MEANS
    any (GIVEN q YIELD q's `name` EQUALS name AND q's `kind` EQUALS `Business trust`) (s's `the parties`)

GIVEN
    links IS A LIST OF Link
    a     IS A STRING
    b     IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`has link` MEANS
    any (GIVEN l YIELD l's `from` EQUALS a AND l's `to` EQUALS b) links

§ `223.3(g): control`

-- 223.3(g)(2): a fiduciary holding does not count towards control, unless the holder is a
-- business trust.  (The text's other exception, "as provided in paragraph (a)(3) of § 223.2",
-- is not encoded: NOTES.md.)
GIVEN
    s IS A Structure
    h IS A Holding
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(g)(2)
`holding counts` MEANS
    (NOT (h's `held as fiduciary`)) OR `names a business trust` s (h's `holder`)

-- 223.3(g)(1)(i) with (g)(3): `x` owns, controls or has power to vote 25 percent or more of any
-- class of voting securities of `y`, counting what its subsidiaries (the companies `x` controls
-- in `rel`) hold.  Each holding is counted once.
GIVEN
    s   IS A Structure
    rel IS A LIST OF Link
    x   IS A STRING
    y   IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(g)(1)(i)
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(g)(3)
`holds a quarter of a class` MEANS
    any (GIVEN c YIELD `percent of` c AT LEAST 25) classes
    WHERE
        holders MEANS x FOLLOWED BY map (GIVEN l YIELD l's `to`) (filter (GIVEN l YIELD l's `from` EQUALS x) rel)
        ofIssuer MEANS filter (GIVEN h YIELD h's `issuer` EQUALS y) (s's `holdings`)
        classes MEANS nub (map (GIVEN h YIELD h's `class`) ofIssuer)
        `percent of` c MEANS
            sum (map (GIVEN h YIELD h's `percent of class`) (filter (GIVEN h YIELD h's `class` EQUALS c AND `holding counts` s h AND elem (h's `holder`) holders) ofIssuer))

-- One step of the definition: given the control pairs found so far, does 223.3(g)(1) make `x`
-- control `y`?  (i) the 25 percent vote test, (ii) electing a majority of the directors,
-- (iii) a Board determination.  The pairs so far are used only positively.
GIVEN
    s   IS A Structure
    rel IS A LIST OF Link
    x   IS A STRING
    y   IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(g)(1)
`control step` MEANS
        `names a company` s y
    AND (   `holds a quarter of a class` s rel x y
         OR `has link` (s's `elections`) x y
         OR `has link` (s's `determinations`) x y)

-- Every ordered pair of distinct parties in which the second is a company.
GIVEN s IS A Structure
GIVETH A LIST OF Link
`candidate control pairs` MEANS
    concat (map (GIVEN p YIELD map (GIVEN q YIELD Link OF p's `name`, q's `name`) (targets p)) (s's `the parties`))
    WHERE
        targets p MEANS filter (GIVEN q YIELD `is a company` s q AND NOT (q's `name` EQUALS p's `name`)) (s's `the parties`)

-- The least fixed point.  `rel` holds the pairs found; `pending` the pairs not yet found.
GIVEN
    s       IS A Structure
    rel     IS A LIST OF Link
    pending IS A LIST OF Link
GIVETH A LIST OF Link
`control from` MEANS
    LET found MEANS partition (GIVEN l YIELD `control step` s rel (l's `from`) (l's `to`)) pending
    IN IF null (fst found)
       THEN rel
       ELSE `control from` s (append rel (fst found)) (snd found)

-- All the control pairs of a structure, attribution through subsidiaries included.
GIVEN s IS A Structure
GIVETH A LIST OF Link
`control relation` MEANS `control from` s EMPTY (`candidate control pairs` s)

-- The pairs found by the first step alone: no attribution through subsidiaries, because nobody
-- is yet a subsidiary.  This is one candidate reading of "directly" in 223.2(b)(1)(iii)
-- (NOTES.md, "Directly controlled").
GIVEN s IS A Structure
GIVETH A LIST OF Link
`direct control relation` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN l YIELD `control step` s EMPTY (l's `from`) (l's `to`)) (`candidate control pairs` s)

-- 223.3(ii): a company that is controlled by the specified company.
GIVEN
    rel IS A LIST OF Link
    x   IS A STRING
    y   IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(ii)
`is a subsidiary of` MEANS `has link` rel x y
